{
  "job_B9.2.5_20251003_114956": {
    "chunk_text": "on Affrice, & mid eallum his f\u00e6relte on se forwear\u00f0. \u00de\u00e6s on \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6fterran geare Hannibal sende sciphere on Rome, & \u00fe\u00e6r ungemetlice gehergeadon. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Lutatia se consul for on Africe mid III hunde scipa to Sicilium, & him Punice \u00fe\u00e6r \u00de\u00e6r wear\u00f0 Lutatia wund \u00feurh o\u00feer cneow. \u00de\u00e6s on mergen com Hanna mid Hannibales firde, & him \u00fe\u00e6r gefeaht wi\u00f0 Lutatia, \u00feeh he wund & Hannan gefliemde, & him \u00e6fter for, o\u00fe he com to Cinam \u00fe\u00e6re byrg. Ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s coman eft Pene mid firde to him, & gefliemde wurdon, & ofslagen II M. \u00dea wilnedon Cartaine o\u00fere si\u00fee fri\u00fees to Romanum. & hie hit him on \u00fe\u00e6t gerad geafon, \u00fe\u00e6t hie him Siciliam to ne tugen, ne Sardiniam, & eac him \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s V hunde wintrum & VII, wear\u00f0 ungemetlic fyrbryne mid \u00dea \u00fe\u00e6t fyr hie alet, \u00fea wear\u00f0 Tiber seo ea swa fledu swa heo n\u00e6fre \u00e6r n\u00e6s ne si\u00fe\u00fean, \u00fe\u00e6t heo On \u00fe\u00e6m dagum \u00fee Titus Sempronius & Gratias Gaius w\u00e6ron consulas on Rome, hie gefuhton wi\u00f0 On \u00fe\u00e6m geare wurdon \u00fea Gallie Romanum wi\u00f0erwearde, \u00fee mon nu h\u00e6t Longbeardas, & ra\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s On hiora \u00fe\u00e6m forman gefeohte w\u00e6s Romana III M ofslagen, & on \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6fterran geare w\u00e6s Gallia \u00dea Romane hamweard foran, \u00fea noldan hie don \u00feone",
